      10 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استملحهُ</span></b>  (assumed tropical:)  <i>He esteemed him,</i> or it, <i>goodly,
beautiful,</i> or <i>pretty;</i> (S, K;) [<i>pleasing to the
eye</i> or <i>ear:</i> (the lexicons passim:)] or <i>found him,</i>
or <i>it, to be so</i> (TA.)

